# The hc (herdr-core) release the testbed image and the package-tests CI job install, and the sha256 of each target's release
# tarball. Read by install-pinned-hc.sh (Dockerfile, .github/workflows/tests.yml) and checked by scripts/testbed-hc-pin.test.mjs.
# KEY=value lines only: this file is sourced by sh.
#
# Bumping hc is a deliberate edit of this file and of the expectations in scripts/testbed-hc-pin.test.mjs, together. Take the three
# values from https://releases.herdr.dev/core/<version>/manifest.json (targets.<target>.sha256) and check each by downloading the
# tarball and hashing it. A target the installer is asked for that is missing here fails the install.
#
# 0.1.17: manifest sha256 a76688138f11464918d7ed46b4d8bc7d03983705ea0fd3027660e90a370a1000, read 2026-11-07.
HC_VERSION=0.1.17
HC_SHA256_LINUX_X86_64=82ec44043f6894bfdb716b979b87cda43fd7fa46b0104e7b7bd93e64d1a9b877
HC_SHA256_LINUX_AARCH64=3a37a454ec63494cf4306db26481fe9db96673d888723701d24f8a992ae8ab8c
HC_SHA256_MACOS_AARCH64=cedbd4d4d9ba1385588198dd4d3c67d2654478f33add5b6445d4d0eb9da5fcf3
